; Zeros of a larger scale than the amounts around them, in every figure of a budget: each figure is the exact sum of
; what it adds up, at the largest scale of its terms, zeros included, as Python's decimal adds (0.00 + 500 is 500.00).
; Food spends all it has, to the cent, before an add of 500; it adds zero, with three decimals, and zero dollars. Rent
; has postings that cancel out but for the last, a posting of zero with three decimals, and transfers zero to Gifts.
; Trip, closed in April, has postings that cancel out before its close; it reads its last month posting by posting.
; Gifts has a posting no price converts, which it leaves out, and postings that cancel out.
option "operating_currency" "CNY"
option "timezone" "UTC"

1970-01-01 commodity CNY
1970-01-01 commodity USD
1970-01-01 commodity XYZ

2024-01-01 open Assets:Bank
2024-01-01 open Expenses:Food
  budget: Food
2024-01-01 open Expenses:Rent
  budget: Rent
2024-01-01 open Expenses:Trip
  budget: Trip
2024-01-01 open Expenses:Gifts
  budget: Gifts

2024-01-01 price USD 7.10 CNY

2024-01-01 budget Food CNY
2024-01-01 budget Rent CNY
2024-01-01 budget Trip CNY
2024-01-01 budget Gifts CNY

2024-01-01 budget-add Food 10.00 CNY
2024-01-01 budget-add Rent 3000 CNY
2024-01-01 budget-add Trip 100 CNY
2024-01-01 budget-add Gifts 50 CNY

; January
2024-01-03 * "Landlord" "January rent"
  Expenses:Rent 100.00 CNY
  Assets:Bank
2024-01-04 * "Landlord" "refunded"
  Expenses:Rent -100.00 CNY
  Assets:Bank
2024-01-05 * "Market" "all of it"
  Expenses:Food 10.00 CNY
  Assets:Bank
2024-01-10 * "Landlord" "the rent"
  Expenses:Rent 50 CNY
  Assets:Bank

; February
2024-02-01 budget-add Food 500 CNY
2024-02-01 * "Shop" "a voucher"
  Expenses:Gifts 1 XYZ
  Assets:Bank
2024-02-03 * "Landlord" "a fee waived"
  Expenses:Rent 0.000 CNY
  Assets:Bank
2024-02-04 * "Landlord" "February rent"
  Expenses:Rent 20 CNY
  Assets:Bank
2024-02-10 budget-transfer Rent Gifts 0.00 CNY

; March
2024-03-01 budget-add Food 0.000 CNY
2024-03-02 budget-add Food 0 USD
2024-03-03 * "Market" "lunch"
  Expenses:Food 5 CNY
  Assets:Bank
2024-03-05 * "Shop" "flowers"
  Expenses:Gifts 8.00 CNY
  Assets:Bank
2024-03-06 * "Shop" "returned"
  Expenses:Gifts -8.00 CNY
  Assets:Bank
2024-03-07 * "Shop" "a card"
  Expenses:Gifts 3 CNY
  Assets:Bank

; April
2024-04-01 * "Airline" "a seat"
  Expenses:Trip 30.00 CNY
  Assets:Bank
2024-04-02 * "Airline" "refunded"
  Expenses:Trip -30.00 CNY
  Assets:Bank
2024-04-03 * "Bus" "a ticket"
  Expenses:Trip 10 CNY
  Assets:Bank
2024-04-15 budget-close Trip
2024-04-20 * "Bus" "after the close"
  Expenses:Trip 99 CNY
  Assets:Bank
